    int mix(int a,int b,float t){int r=(int)(((a>>16)&255)*(1-t)+((b>>16)&255)*t),g=(int)(((a>>8)&255)*(1-t)+((b>>8)&255)*t),bl=(int)((a&255)*(1-t)+(b&255)*t);return 0xff000000|(r<<16)|(g<<8)|bl;}
    TextView eyebrow(String t){TextView x=label(t,11,MUTED,true);x.setLetterSpacing(.16f);x.setPadding(dp(4),dp(10),0,dp(8));return x;}
    int alignedSampleCount(){return Math.min(history.size(),Math.min(sampleTimes.size(),Math.min(sampleTemps.size(),Math.min(sampleCurrents.size(),Math.min(sampleVoltages.size(),sampleStatuses.size())))));}
    float[] chartStats(){long span=chartPeriod.equals("6 часов")?21600000L:chartPeriod.equals("7 дней")?604800000L:86400000L;long cutoff=System.currentTimeMillis()-span;float mn=Float.MAX_VALUE,mx=-Float.MAX_VALUE,sum=0;int n=0;for(int i=0;i<alignedSampleCount();i++){if(sampleTimes.get(i)<cutoff)continue;float v;if(chartMetric.equals("Температура"))v=sampleTemps.get(i)<0?Float.NaN:sampleTemps.get(i)/10f;else if(chartMetric.equals("Ток"))v=sampleCurrents.get(i)==Integer.MIN_VALUE?Float.NaN:sampleCurrents.get(i)/1000f;else if(chartMetric.equals("Напряжение"))v=sampleVoltages.get(i)<0?Float.NaN:sampleVoltages.get(i)/1000f;else v=history.get(i);if(Float.isNaN(v))continue;mn=Math.min(mn,v);mx=Math.max(mx,v);sum+=v;n++;}return n==0?null:new float[]{mn,mx,sum/n};}
    LinearLayout statsRow(){float[] st=chartStats();String u=chartMetric.equals("Заряд")?"%":chartMetric.equals("Температура")?"°C":chartMetric.equals("Ток")?"mA":"V";LinearLayout r=row();r.setGravity(Gravity.TOP);String[] names={"МИН","СРЕДНЕЕ","МАКС"};int[] ix={0,2,1};for(int k=0;k<3;k++){LinearLayout t=column();t.setGravity(Gravity.CENTER);t.setPadding(dp(6),dp(10),dp(6),dp(10));t.setBackground(shape(0x66101c30,14,0x2294a5bb));t.addView(label(names[k],11,MUTED,true));t.addView(num(st==null?"—":String.format(Locale.getDefault(),"%.1f",st[ix[k]])+" "+u,18,TEXT));LinearLayout.LayoutParams tp=new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(0,-2,1);tp.setMargins(dp(k==0?0:4),0,dp(k==2?0:4),0);r.addView(t,tp);}LinearLayout.LayoutParams rp=new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(-1,-2);rp.topMargin=dp(12);r.setLayoutParams(rp);return r;}
    class ChargeBar extends View{Paint p=new Paint(3);ChargeBar(){super(MainActivity.this);}protected void onDraw(Canvas c){int n=20;float w=getWidth(),h=getHeight(),gap=dp(3),sw=(w-gap*(n-1))/n,fill=level/100f*n;boolean live=batteryStatus==2&&!reducedMotion();int main=level<=15?RED:level<=30?ORANGE:GREEN;p.setStyle(Paint.Style.FILL);for(int i=0;i<n;i++){float x=i*(sw+gap),f=Math.max(0f,Math.min(1f,fill-i));p.setColor(0x3394a5bb);c.drawRoundRect(x,0,x+sw,h,dp(3),dp(3),p);if(f>0){p.setColor(mix(main,BLUE,i/(float)(n-1)));if(live&&i==(int)fill)p.setAlpha((int)(110+145*(0.5+0.5*Math.sin(System.currentTimeMillis()/260.0))));c.drawRoundRect(x,0,x+sw*f,h,dp(3),dp(3),p);}}if(live)postInvalidateOnAnimation();}}
    int healthColor(){return healthCode==2?GREEN:(healthCode==3||healthCode==4||healthCode==5||healthCode==7)?RED:MUTED;}
    void buildShell(){root=column();GradientDrawable backdrop=new GradientDrawable(GradientDrawable.Orientation.TL_BR,new int[]{0xff10213a,0xff080f1d,0xff0c1729,0xff080f1d});root.setBackground(backdrop);root.setPadding(dp(18),dp(18),dp(18),dp(9));root.setOnApplyWindowInsetsListener((v,insets)->{v.setPadding(dp(18),dp(18)+insets.getSystemWindowInsetTop(),dp(18),dp(9)+insets.getSystemWindowInsetBottom());return insets;});LinearLayout head=row();TextView brand=label("BATTERY",12,MUTED,true);TextView mark=label("  42 · 4.4.1",13,GREEN,true);head.addView(brand);head.addView(mark);head.addView(new View(this),new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(0,1,1));TextView live=label("●  МОНИТОРИНГ АКТИВЕН",9,GREEN,true);head.addView(live);root.addView(head);
        TextView heading=label("Твоя энергия.\nПод контролем.",29,TEXT,true);LinearLayout.LayoutParams hp=new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(-1,-2);hp.topMargin=dp(17);hp.bottomMargin=dp(4);root.addView(heading,hp);
        TextView sub=label("Интеллектуальная система мониторинга",12,MUTED,false);root.addView(sub);
        ScrollView scroll=new ScrollView(this);scroll.setFillViewport(false);content=column();content.setPadding(0,dp(18),0,dp(10));scroll.addView(content);root.addView(scroll,new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(-1,0,1));
        nav=row();nav.setPadding(dp(4),dp(4),dp(4),dp(4));GradientDrawable navBg=new GradientDrawable();navBg.setColor(0xf0101c30);navBg.setCornerRadius(dp(22));navBg.setStroke(dp(1),0x3394a5bb);nav.setBackground(navBg);nav.setElevation(dp(3));String[] tabs={"Обзор","Зарядка","История","Состояние","Диагностика","Настройки"};String[] shortTabs={"Обзор","Заряд","Архив","Батарея","Тесты","Настр."};for(int k=0;k<tabs.length;k++){String s=tabs[k];LinearLayout tab=column();tab.setGravity(Gravity.CENTER);tab.setMinimumHeight(dp(56));tab.setPadding(dp(1),dp(6),dp(1),dp(4));tab.addView(new NavIcon(k),new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(dp(24),dp(24)));TextView t=label(shortTabs[k],10,MUTED,true);t.setContentDescription(s);tab.setContentDescription(s);t.setLetterSpacing(0f);t.setGravity(Gravity.CENTER);t.setSingleLine(true);if(Build.VERSION.SDK_INT>=26)t.setAutoSizeTextTypeUniformWithConfiguration(9,11,1,android.util.TypedValue.COMPLEX_UNIT_SP);else t.setTextSize(9);LinearLayout.LayoutParams tp=new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(-1,-2);tp.topMargin=dp(2);tab.addView(t,tp);View ind=new View(this);ind.setBackground(shape(GREEN,2,0));ind.setAlpha(0f);LinearLayout.LayoutParams ip=new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(dp(16),dp(3));ip.topMargin=dp(3);tab.addView(ind,ip);tab.setTag(s);nav.addView(tab,new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(0,-2,1));tab.setOnClickListener(v->{v.performHapticFeedback(HapticFeedbackConstants.VIRTUAL_KEY);page=s;buildPage();updateNavStyles();});}LinearLayout.LayoutParams np=new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(-1,-2);np.topMargin=dp(6);root.addView(nav,np);setContentView(root);buildPage();updateNavStyles();} void updateNavStyles(){if(nav==null)return;for(int j=0;j<nav.getChildCount();j++){LinearLayout x=(LinearLayout)nav.getChildAt(j);boolean sel=page.equals(x.getTag());((NavIcon)x.getChildAt(0)).setActive(sel);x.getChildAt(2).animate().alpha(sel?1f:0f).setDuration(200).start();x.getChildAt(0).animate().scaleX(sel?1.12f:1f).scaleY(sel?1.12f:1f).setDuration(200).start();((TextView)x.getChildAt(1)).setTextColor(sel?GREEN:MUTED);x.setBackground(ripple(shape(sel?0x1f65e7c0:0x00000000,16,0),16));}}
    class NavIcon extends View{int k,tint=0;boolean on;Paint p=new Paint(3);NavIcon(int k){super(MainActivity.this);this.k=k;}void setActive(boolean a){on=a;invalidate();}protected void onDraw(Canvas c){float sc=Math.min(getWidth(),getHeight())/24f;c.scale(sc,sc);p.setStyle(Paint.Style.STROKE);p.setStrokeWidth(2f);p.setStrokeCap(Paint.Cap.ROUND);p.setStrokeJoin(Paint.Join.ROUND);p.setColor(tint!=0?tint:(on?GREEN:MUTED));Path a=new Path();
        if(k==0){c.drawCircle(12,12,8.5f,p);a.moveTo(12,12);a.lineTo(15.5f,8.5f);c.drawPath(a,p);}
        else if(k==1){a.moveTo(13,3);a.lineTo(6,13);a.lineTo(12,13);a.lineTo(11,21);a.lineTo(18,10);a.lineTo(12,10);a.close();c.drawPath(a,p);}
        else if(k==2){c.drawCircle(12,12,8.5f,p);a.moveTo(12,7);a.lineTo(12,12);a.lineTo(15.5f,14);c.drawPath(a,p);}
        else if(k==3){a.moveTo(12,3);a.lineTo(19,6);a.lineTo(19,12);a.cubicTo(19,16.5f,16,19.5f,12,21);a.cubicTo(8,19.5f,5,16.5f,5,12);a.lineTo(5,6);a.close();c.drawPath(a,p);Path m=new Path();m.moveTo(9,12);m.lineTo(11.2f,14.2f);m.lineTo(15,10);c.drawPath(m,p);}
        else if(k==4){a.moveTo(2,12);a.lineTo(7,12);a.lineTo(9.5f,6);a.lineTo(14,18);a.lineTo(16.5f,12);a.lineTo(22,12);c.drawPath(a,p);}
        else{c.drawLine(4,7,20,7,p);c.drawLine(4,12,20,12,p);c.drawLine(4,17,20,17,p);p.setStyle(Paint.Style.FILL);c.drawCircle(9,7,2.3f,p);c.drawCircle(15,12,2.3f,p);c.drawCircle(8,17,2.3f,p);}}}
    void buildPage(){content.removeAllViews();if(page.equals("Обзор"))overview();else if(page.equals("Зарядка"))chargePage();else if(page.equals("История"))historyPage();else if(page.equals("Состояние"))healthPage();else if(page.equals("Диагностика"))diagnosticsPage();else if(page.equals("Настройки"))settingsPage();else tipsPage();animateContent();}
